## 3. Security Model

### 3.1 API Key Scopes
```bash
# Generate key with scopes
ax --generate-key --scopes "tools,agents,mcp,chat" --name "ci-server"

# Valid scopes:
- chat: Basic chat functionality
- tools.run_sh: Shell command execution
- tools.read_file: File reading
- agents: Agent spawning/scheduling
- mcp: MCP server access
- admin: Full access
```

### 3.2 Trust Validation
```go
func validateToolExecution(tool string, apiKey string) error {
    scopes := getKeyScopes(apiKey)

    requiredScope := "tools"
    if tool != "chat" {
        requiredScope = fmt.Sprintf("tools.%s", tool)
    }

    if !slices.Contains(scopes, requiredScope) {
        return fmt.Errorf("insufficient trust for tool '%s'", tool)
    }

    return nil
}
```

